              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha nchiona ruwiya yanjina na Mwenyezi Mlungu achinionyesa Joshuwa, mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu, aimire mbere za malaika wa Mwenyezi Mlungu, na Shetani kala aimire uphande wa mkpwonowe wa kulume ili amshitaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu naakudemurire uwe Shetani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JUD.1.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Juda 1:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho ye malaika wa Mwenyezi Mlungu achimuamba Shetani, “Mwenyezi Mlungu yetsambula Jerusalemu naakudemurire! Mutu hiyu ni dza chinga cha moho chichotuluzwa mohoni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati uho Joshuwa kala aimire mbere za ye malaika kuno akavwala nguwo za nongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye malaika achiaambira nyo ariokala aimire mbereze, “Mvuleni zo nguwo za nongo.” Chisha achimuamba Joshuwa hivi, “Sikiza, nikakuusira uyio na nindakuvwika mavwazi manono.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami nchiamba, “Mfungeni chiremba chiswafi.” Nao achimfunga chiremba chiswafi na achimvwika mavwazi ga ulavyadzi-sadaka kuno malaika wa Mwenyezi Mlungu aimire pho kanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
