              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "33:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.6.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zakariya 6:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi phundza uwe Joshuwa, mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu na ayao asagalao mberezo, mana aho ni ishara ya mambo manono gedzago. Mimi nindareha mtumishi wangu aihwaye Panda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lola, mimi nkaika dziwe mbere za Joshuwa na dziwe hiro mwenga rina pande sabaa. Nami nindatsonga maneno dzulu ya ro dziwe na niuse makosa ga tsi ihi siku mwenga.’ ” Gaga ndigo aambago Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa majeshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MIC.4.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mika 4:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Siku iyo, chila mmwenga wenu andamualika jiraniwe edze asagale naye kpwa amani tsini ya mzabibuwe na mtiniwe,” Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa majeshi anaamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
